# Project Overview

The purpose of Project 4 is to develop the software architecture for our Final Grade Calculator. Our team will design the application as cloud-based software and identify its major components, subcomponents, database structure, and necessary application files.

The Final Grade Calculator is designed to help college students monitor their academic performance by calculating current course grades, determining the scores needed on final examinations, and estimating their final course grades.

Our proposed architecture will use Java, Spring Boot, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, MySQL, and Docker.

